<title>USA: Food Lion acquires Kash n' Karry.</title>
<headline>Food Lion acquires Kash n' Karry.</headline>
<dateline>SALISBURY, N.C. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Lion Inc said Wednesday it had completed its tender offer and merger of Kash n' Karry Food Stores Inc.  </p>
<p>The company, which acquired 90 percent of Kash's outstanding shares on December 18, said it would convert it into a wholly-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>Food Lion has more than 72,000 employees.</p>
</text>
